3:33Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T19:59:11Z","closed_at":"2026-02-02T19:59:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.7.1) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M2 Ultra (Apple8) - Apple M2 Ultra (24 threads) - 64.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere appears to be a rather nasty memory leak in the current top-of-the-tree build 4.5.1.stable. At least on MacOS / Metal, not sure about other platforms. I was messing with some compute stuff and discovered a steady mystery RAM leak of about ~0.25MB/second or ~1MB every 4 seconds. \n\nI've spent some good time digging the project to make sure I'm not leaking anything like orphan node instances or dynamic resources etc. But it is happening even on a static scene with zero activity other than compute task being dispatched every frame on the render thread. \n\nEventually I stumbled on some official Godot demo/test projects on Github and tried the Compute Texture one from [>>> here <<<](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/compute/texture).\n\nWithout any modifications to stock Compute Texture demo project this is what I get after bout ~5 minutes of run:\n\n<img width=\"1219\" height=\"288\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cdf2c75d-c3d0-4831-a909-3f97835efdd5\" />\n\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen Godot [Compute Texture](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/compute/texture) demo project on MacOS and run. Attaching it blow as there seems to be no way to submit the bug without attaching a repro project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[texture.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23238890/texture.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/issues/1269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/issues/1269/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}